    prompt: "Variation of the drift root (own it — no scaffold): your automatic retraining made the model WORSE — it retrained on drifted, biased data. Fix the retrain loop.",
    context: "You get the incident only. Bring your own validation and promotion design.",
    produce: { artifact: "why auto-retrain degraded + the validation/promote gate (champion-challenger, holdout) + the data-quality guard + tradeoffs", format: "design-doc", workspace: "in-app-text" },
    stages: [{"id":"twist","title":"The twist — auto-retrain made it worse","ask":"Automatic retraining made the model WORSE — it trained on drifted, biased data. Fix the loop.","attemptHint":"What was missing between 'drift detected' and 'ship new model'?","model":"Blind auto-retrain promoted a model trained on anomalous/biased data with no gate. Fix: validate every retrained model against a clean held-out benchmark and gate deploy on it, retrain on a principled trigger (validated concept drift, not any blip), guard the training data for anomalies/poisoning, and ship behind a canary with rollback. Automation needs a quality gate, not blind trust.","heuristic":"Auto-retrain without a validation gate automates regressions; gate on a clean benchmark before promotion.","control":"Post-retrain eval-gate pass; training-data anomaly checks.","trap":"Retraining on any drift and auto-promoting with no gate.","tell":"A retrain loop that ships a worse model onto production.","anchors":[{"dim":"promote-gate","anchor":"do you require a challenger to beat the champion on a trusted holdout BEFORE promotion?","cost":"auto-promotion ships a worse model"},{"dim":"data-quality-guard","anchor":"how do you stop retraining on drifted/poisoned/biased data?","cost":"the model learns the drift and degrades further"},{"dim":"shadow-eval","anchor":"shadow/canary the challenger on live traffic before full promote?","cost":"you find out it is worse only after it ships"},{"dim":"tradeoff","anchor":"retrain freshness vs stability/validation cost stated?","cost":"reads as no real decision"}]}],
